            <div xml:id="m-cf6ffdd2-872d-4095-b535-e2011954b859">
              <lg xml:id="m-12cbc4a0-c4c8-4ea2-8347-daf86a801a87">
                <l xml:id="m-8b6561a6-a408-4a1e-ac8e-eb27ae7e3e9e" facs="#m-cd73c199-1f99-4b0a-8a47-9d27a6b730aa" label="text-like">and Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-07c37ced-d3a8-4c12-af19-7f4df4ea95f9" facs="#m-d5450b56-6406-4c2d-9eba-565de7c602d1" label="ambiguous">327</l><l xml:id="m-ce596b2b-7c5d-43a4-b693-4a2e7f619322" facs="#m-e441d498-6fd7-49a7-81d2-94472871ae09" label="lyrics-like">3. Praésta, Páter pi¬ Issime, Patríque cómpar Unice, Cum</l><l xml:id="m-14938b98-7cc0-4efa-8b7e-6d7af3751d25" facs="#m-3bec07fb-c9ae-4179-828d-be6bb17764e0" label="lyrics-like">Spíri-tu Pa-rácli-to, Régnans per ómne saéculum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6bc95e57-0002-43a2-b134-0b4fa6d4a825" facs="#m-2b9b8e6d-3ab3-463c-878a-f3ce0b6862a3" label="text-like">The Hymn of Compline is sung in this Tone all during Advent until</l><l xml:id="m-cb28f241-485c-4262-ba25-f440ae484486" facs="#m-d95b0376-c59f-43b7-985f-94f2e931b6f3" label="text-like">Christmas Eve exclusive, even on Feasts. But on the Feast of the Immacu¬</l><l xml:id="m-919b8ee5-c993-471d-9ac3-9766a4fd8d79" facs="#m-df9f7d83-587e-4404-a783-cbb8a64d0e96" label="text-like">late Conception and during its Octave, the ordinary Tone for the Feasts ot</l><l xml:id="m-b3dd65a6-3ba6-4997-b85d-a3f0ce2dec97" facs="#m-931cb994-6998-4e92-a145-825596a5b509" label="text-like">the B. M. V. is used, except on the Sunday within the Octave, and on the</l><l xml:id="m-1fa85df8-a918-441c-a6a0-3100a045c080" facs="#m-ef18cc9b-2c7e-4d9e-9a00-a7ef290083db" label="text-like">Octave day itself if this should fall on a Sunday, when the Tone for Advent</l><l xml:id="m-cb832bd0-1c0f-437b-8b6a-9338f082859d" facs="#m-1e05c961-f825-4ef9-87fd-6774d87c1824" label="text-like">is used, with the doxology of thie Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-a79dc542-e1f2-4a65-839c-f5a383d2eb81" facs="#m-5fa93d29-6e75-4a0e-80a8-97df3bf31416" label="text-like">Saturday before the Second Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-5e12ef97-8ead-4e4a-a3e9-aadf911a0aa5" facs="#m-9e5b777c-7df8-467c-8989-b7a8f46c42ad" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-227ac754-cdb6-4d59-bf8b-d3b06a025e8f" facs="#m-246b72b9-8707-4a6b-9066-f76b3e888560" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Benedíctus Dóminus. I. g. 190. — 2. Déus cánticum. 7. d.</l><l xml:id="m-4d662732-0de0-47ad-b30c-88acb88e8f4d" facs="#m-4b92cafd-1fef-44ff-a174-566b264922db" label="lyrics-like">193. — 3. Exaltábo te. 7. a. 196. — 4. Miserátor. I. f. 197. — 5. Fidélis</l><l xml:id="m-83f1472b-183c-4fda-9960-ab14507cbd8d" facs="#m-cae4610c-6ab9-48c9-88c9-6a936dbd973f" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus. 3. a. 200.</l><l xml:id="m-7191b3c4-d41b-4177-9c59-742b06433da9" facs="#m-92959173-f8f9-4418-a56e-23d95227b98f" label="text-like">Antiphons from Vespers or the and Sunday of Advent, p. 881.</l><l xml:id="m-69c2d1b1-f94f-4f74-bafa-a4f933aea199" facs="#m-796c2c23-563a-43ae-99f0-bbcf97941ffa" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Fratres: Quaecúmque. p. 333. Hymn. Creátor âlme síde¬</l><l xml:id="m-70f2aae8-38cf-405c-88af-850d111b1f03" facs="#m-daa6864c-72d9-4474-af69-c6739b576902" label="lyrics-like">rum. p. 324. V. Roráte.</l><l xml:id="m-ebb93360-93fe-4c34-8db0-6a609b09d958" facs="#m-66d59c4c-2cdf-42c5-ab48-013159d70e8e" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-f134602d-eadf-4c87-b477-1a88ff6c9d16" facs="#m-6f4fb378-9981-4b62-b272-0e621c554c7f" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7. a</l><l xml:id="m-26c2c981-e6f9-4e30-afc1-e45abaeeec27" facs="#m-1917c5de-77e5-4b2e-a4a0-bfc66d4a23e6" label="lyrics-like">Eni Dómine “vi-si-táre nos in páce,</l><l xml:id="m-a0e69f6e-f10b-4a13-ab52-b7bd702bb371" facs="#m-7cc780c7-e475-4d2f-94ce-13002fc46712" label="lyrics-like">ut laeté¬</l><l xml:id="m-84f03254-a55d-4277-a1b5-8eab8c1fc4c0" facs="#m-d05ee158-4b46-40a8-a798-0a4fce4e214e" label="ambiguous">X</l><l xml:id="m-54aabb86-61de-4c91-b246-e63c90b322cd" facs="#m-6597d70f-f2a6-453f-9198-b9e9308675e7" label="lyrics-like">mur coram te córde perfécto. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3df77b59-d1b2-4a82-84d5-27a8a7229949" facs="#m-3882d503-bc77-4e97-9135-ce671733a710" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 7. a. p. 211. — Prayer. Excita. p. 328.</l><l xml:id="m-46cb35f6-6f2f-46ef-bcf5-21019264e871" facs="#m-207a1b68-864f-476f-ae6c-ed0f5f409498" label="text-like">The Second Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-513b0255-bce4-4a5b-874b-b71b25e4d499" facs="#m-c438b6dd-65b7-4bef-b4a8-83e8dffb029b" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Ecce in núbibus caéli. p. 331.</l><l xml:id="m-98b93400-9421-43f8-9f52-9808e75859f5" facs="#m-67c240ce-cdf0-4d62-924b-e971514f3e8d" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-bc31544b-03b6-450a-840a-0dd1857c8d2c" facs="#m-707d5349-c34a-4f7d-9fe9-bc65aad07052" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Urbs. p. 332. Chapter from Vespers. Fratres: Quaecúmque</l><l xml:id="m-a36ca89f-b523-4a4f-b711-cd7af89c1048" facs="#m-9271362f-252d-44a2-b561-0041217cc56a" label="lyrics-like">scripta sunt. p. 333. Shori Resp. Véni ad liberándum nos¬ 288.</l><l xml:id="m-9fe9c20f-4337-4d9a-95e9-750617e212b1" facs="#m-05a1ce8b-3b57-4e9d-a06f-a3c813755ee2" label="lyrics-like">v. Timébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-f9e6b4a1-5f6c-4ab6-ae56-699c031e07c8" facs="#m-92937b3a-e717-4c88-a60b-7bfe6bfcc7d7" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-e879b459-7502-435b-8141-f1b5e768d73d" facs="#m-3eed23c2-7ac0-4771-98ad-55ba4755352b" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-0c9263ff-0f33-422a-9bc0-ddf70a23db82" facs="#m-f4cfd5ff-f81d-48a7-b7da-bc28a8c3cbe5" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-276c8361-07a1-4461-ab4a-08653a2d7c02" facs="#m-2d0328b2-cc9b-4b19-a1b8-ce53a3c9514d" label="ambiguous">¬</l><l xml:id="m-683ab61e-ca31-49b8-a70e-28ff4e0b09fd" facs="#m-62fb485a-aac7-4925-8d1e-e561fd7c1a08" label="lyrics-like">O-pulus Si-on, *ec-ce Dó-minus véni¬</l><l xml:id="m-927661ff-047d-4f52-a891-47d69f9b220e" facs="#m-fed71cf5-3add-4d84-885e-78600bf5b88f" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-afdf72e2-8bc6-4149-ae85-ee70282ef4f3" facs="#m-602c824a-86b1-4683-a6d5-ca08cc96773e" label="ambiguous">L</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
